### [ADMIN] 쿠폰 템플릿 등록 (정률)
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin.user

{
  "name": "신규가입 10% 할인",
  "type": "RATE",
  "value": 10,
  "minOrderAmount": 10000,
  "expiredAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59"
}

### [ADMIN] 쿠폰 템플릿 등록 (정액)
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
